    {
      "id": "municipal-population",
      "label": "市区町村の人口",
      "geometry": "area",
      "source": {
        "kind": "estat-metric",
        "metricKey": "total-population",
        "entity": "city"
      },
      "time": {
        "axis": "census-5y",
        "match": "latest-before"
      },
      "geography": {
        "unit": "municipality",
        "boundary": "municipality-merged-designated-city"
      },
      "scopes": [
        "region",
        "prefecture"
      ],
      "measure": {
        "label": "人口",
        "unit": "人"
      },
      "style": {
        "kind": "sequential",
        "scale": "log"
      },
      "notes": [
        "国勢調査の 5 年ごとの値。スライダーの年に調査が無いときは、その年以前で最も近い調査年の値を年を明示して描く。",
        "合併を今の市区町村の境界に組み替えた系列 (例: 浜松市 22130 の 1980 年は合併前の周辺市町村を含む 698,982 人。2026-10-29 に R2 で確認)。",
        "政令指定都市は市全体だけを使い、行政区の行と二重に数えない。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "municipal-population-change",
      "label": "市区町村の人口の増減率 (1980年比)",
      "geometry": "area",
      "source": {
        "kind": "estat-metric",
        "metricKey": "total-population",
        "entity": "city"
      },
      "derive": {
        "kind": "change-rate-from-base-year",
        "baseYear": 1980
      },
      "time": {
        "axis": "census-5y",
        "match": "latest-before"
      },
      "geography": {
        "unit": "municipality",
        "boundary": "municipality-merged-designated-city"
      },
      "scopes": [
        "region",
        "prefecture"
      ],
      "measure": {
        "label": "1980年比の増減率",
        "unit": "%"
      },
      "style": {
        "kind": "diverging"
      },
      "notes": [
        "国勢調査の 1980 年の人口を基準にした増減率。合併を今の市区町村の境界に組み替えた系列なので、合併の前後で比べられる。",
        "増加は緑、減少は赤。色の濃さは全国の全年の値で決める。"
      ]
    },
